  "Oh ho! Sounds swell.": "",
  "Yo!": "",
  "Ah, thanks as always.": "",
  "Somethin' wrong today?": "",
  "Ah, nah. Had some business nearby.": "",
  "Thought I'd come say hi.": "",
  "Heh heh. That so?": "",
